#
# xTS verification image for the Agora ConvoAI Kit R1 (Beken BK7258), CPU0.
#
# Console is UART0 on GPIO10/GPIO11, which reaches the host through the
# on-board CH340 USB-serial bridge.
#
# This is configs/nsh with the whole mandatory self-test set switched on and
# the product features that will not fit alongside it switched off: the
# closed BLE stack and its dependencies (unqlite, libuv, mbedtls) and the
# three demo applications (eyes, face, snap).  The app partition is 1728 KB
# and configs/nsh already occupies 93% of it, so the two cannot coexist.
#
# Run the mandatory cases against this image, then flash configs/nsh back.
# That order is what the openvela porting guide describes -- self-test is a
# verification build, not the shipping one.
#
# Build:
#   ./build.sh vendor/openvela/boards/contest2026_252_board/configs/xts \
#       --cmake -j8
#
# Note that adding a CONFIG here requires deleting cmake_out/<board>_xts
# first; see the discipline note in the repository CLAUDE.md.
#
